+OfflineLegCalibrationSpec                         ArmableLfSessionSpec  §4
+  (RF/RH/LH and LF; NEVER accepted by the           (LF only, SEALED;
+   engine; NOT implemented in G3 — R3-13)            exact identity — §4.3/§4.4)
+                                                  ▼
